1
00:00:02,250 --> 00:00:05,166
I never imagined we'd meet
as sisters like this.

2
00:00:06,916 --> 00:00:08,166
Stop it, Sayuri.

3
00:00:08,916 --> 00:00:09,833
Mayura...

4
00:00:10,291 --> 00:00:13,500
Don't call me that.
I don't have a sister!

5
00:00:13,875 --> 00:00:16,541
Mayura, what are you saying?
Sayuri really is...

6
00:00:17,041 --> 00:00:20,833
For twelve years, Mayuki and I
have relied on each other.

7
00:00:21,958 --> 00:00:25,916
I'm the only daughter of the
Hazuki family. I have no sister.

8
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:28,333
Mayura...

9
00:00:28,666 --> 00:00:30,166
And now you tell me...

10
00:00:30,833 --> 00:00:33,166
Now you say we're sisters?
But I've always had...

11
00:00:33,166 --> 00:00:35,625
Mayuki... and...

12
00:00:39,041 --> 00:00:40,291
Mayuki...

13
00:00:41,916 --> 00:00:42,875
Sis...

14
00:00:46,833 --> 00:00:48,958
It's all right now.
Everything's all right.

15
00:00:49,958 --> 00:00:51,500
There's nothing to be afraid of.

16
00:00:52,291 --> 00:00:54,208
It's too late, Sayuri.

17
00:00:56,041 --> 00:00:58,208
There's no going back now.

18
00:00:59,375 --> 00:01:01,416
There's too much blood
on my hands.

19
00:01:02,125 --> 00:01:03,333
Mayura...

20
00:01:05,125 --> 00:01:08,750
There's still one more verse
left for me to fulfil.

21
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:11,416
Sayuri...

22
00:01:12,125 --> 00:01:15,250
Please, take care of Mayuki.

23
00:01:18,333 --> 00:01:19,166
Mayura!

24
00:01:19,208 --> 00:01:20,000
What?!

25
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:21,083
Mayura!

26
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:30,708
Into the demon's abyss,
the beautiful goddess falls.

27
00:01:32,375 --> 00:01:37,833
She used her own body
to complete the curse song...

28
00:01:48,791 --> 00:01:50,250
Mayura...

29
00:01:50,583 --> 00:01:54,500
I don't know what
you were trying to protect.

30
00:01:56,291 --> 00:01:58,500
And now, it hardly matters.

31
00:02:00,125 --> 00:02:01,666
But Mayura...

32
00:02:02,333 --> 00:02:04,416
You refused to see
what truly mattered.

33
00:02:05,708 --> 00:02:09,875
Someone who loved you
with all their heart...

34
00:02:11,125 --> 00:02:13,166
...and longed for you
to love them back.

35
00:02:14,166 --> 00:02:17,708
Why couldn't you find the courage
to open your eyes?!

36
00:02:18,958 --> 00:02:20,208
Hajime...

37
00:02:24,875 --> 00:02:27,833
Answer me, Mayura!
